 "machineSetting": "model",
 "_controls_note": "P1 is the joystick (or the CD32's pad) in port 2, P2 a joystick in port 1. Mouse Left, Right and Middle are the mouse's buttons in port 1, and Mouse X and Mouse Y how far it moves in a frame, in the mouse's own counts. Previous Disk and Next Disk move a selector over the project's disks; Eject Disk takes the disk out of the drive for as long as it is held and puts the selected one in when it is let go. Then the 96 keys of the Amiga's keyboard, under the names printed on them. Which of them are live depends on the Port 1 and Port 2 settings.",
